497
00:44:50,000 --> 00:44:51,900
Military targets were the objective.

498
00:44:52,280 --> 00:44:54,200
Innocent civilians paid the price.

499
00:44:54,760 --> 00:44:56,640
I believe there were several thousand people killed.

500
00:44:57,160 --> 00:44:58,200
Tactical error.

501
00:44:58,720 --> 00:45:01,300
Bomber command was just not hitting its targets.

502
00:45:01,760 --> 00:45:02,980
Or collateral damage.

503
00:45:03,300 --> 00:45:05,780
At the time, they were the enemy.

504
00:45:06,300 --> 00:45:07,300
On History Undercover.

505
